#: templates/parts/space-settings-panel-general.php:359
msgid "Top level"
msgstr "Bovenste niveau"

#: templates/parts/space-settings-panel-general.php:362
msgid ""
"There is no other top-level space you manage that this one could sit under."
msgstr ""
"Er is geen andere ruimte op het bovenste niveau die je beheert waaronder "
"deze ruimte kan vallen."

